{"content_hash": "0f12f399a1bed123", "version_id": 813, "article_id": 82, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "XPeng launches MONA L05 SUV from 139,800 yuan", "title_zh": "小鹏 MONA L05 上市，13.98 万元起", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1686761?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720774401213-08da3073d9e2?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fG1vbmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzMyMjkyNnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Richard Multimedia on Unsplash", "author": "Richard Multimedia", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rmultimedia?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-standing-in-front-of-a-painting-WW4M24Z_yw4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(286, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(324, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "22de88a019f8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-30", "word_count": 178, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "XPeng has added a new SUV to its MONA line, and it hopes to avoid the delivery problems that followed its last launch. The L05 starts at 139,800 yuan and will also be sold outside China.", "lead_zh": "小鹏为 MONA 系列新增了一款 SUV，希望避免上一款车上市后出现的交付问题。L05 起售价 13.98 万元，未来也将在海外销售。", "preview": "XPeng launched the MONA L05 on Tuesday, with six versions priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan after a limited discount. The car comes in pur", "preview_zh": "小鹏周二发布 MONA L05，共六款车型，限时优惠后售价 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。新车提供纯电和增程两种动力。由于此前的 L03 交付拖延严重，小鹏这次在上市前就提前生产了 5000 台 L05。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 798, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 85.95, "size_bytes": 516672, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 88.75, "size_bytes": 533520, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 94.075, "size_bytes": 565344, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 80.8, "size_bytes": 485712, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 88.9, "size_bytes": 534384, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d92c8fa/content/data/versions/813.json", "paragraphs": ["XPeng launched the MONA L05 on Tuesday, with six versions priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan after a limited discount. The car comes in pure electric and extended-range forms. Because the earlier L03 model faced long delivery delays, XPeng built 5,000 L05 cars before the launch.", "The L05 is 4,870mm long, but its wheelbase reaches 2,940mm, so passengers get more room inside. The front boot holds 102 litres, while the rear space grows to 1,913 litres when the seats fold down. XPeng showed that nine suitcases fit when five people are on board.", "The electric version offers up to 635km of range and charges from 30% to 80% in about 16 minutes. The extended-range model can travel 1,310km in total. Top versions use two of XPeng's own AI chips, which support its advanced driver-assistance system.", "The MONA series has now sold more than 360,000 cars. The L05 was designed for both left-hand and right-hand driving, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. XPeng says most MONA buyers choose the smart-driving versions."], "paragraphs_zh": ["小鹏周二发布 MONA L05，共六款车型，限时优惠后售价 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。新车提供纯电和增程两种动力。由于此前的 L03 交付拖延严重，小鹏这次在上市前就提前生产了 5000 台 L05。", "L05 车长 4870 毫米，但轴距达到 2940 毫米，因此车内空间更宽敞。前备厢容积 102 升，后排座椅放倒后空间可扩展到 1913 升。小鹏现场演示了五人满座时能装下九个行李箱。", "纯电版最高续航 635 公里，电量从 30% 充到 80% 约需 16 分钟。增程版综合续航可达 1310 公里。顶配车型搭载两颗小鹏自研 AI 芯片，用于支持高阶智驾系统。", "MONA 系列累计销量已超过 36 万台。L05 从立项起就同时开发左舵和右舵版本，小鹏计划在 82 个国家销售，并于 2027 年初进入欧洲。小鹏表示，多数 MONA 买家会选择智驾版本。"], "body": "XPeng launched the MONA L05 on Tuesday, with six versions priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan after a limited discount. The car comes in pure electric and extended-range forms. Because the earlier L03 model faced long delivery delays, XPeng built 5,000 L05 cars before the launch.\n\nThe L05 is 4,870mm long, but its wheelbase reaches 2,940mm, so passengers get more room inside. The front boot holds 102 litres, while the rear space grows to 1,913 litres when the seats fold down. XPeng showed that nine suitcases fit when five people are on board.\n\nThe electric version offers up to 635km of range and charges from 30% to 80% in about 16 minutes. The extended-range model can travel 1,310km in total. Top versions use two of XPeng's own AI chips, which support its advanced driver-assistance system.\n\nThe MONA series has now sold more than 360,000 cars. The L05 was designed for both left-hand and right-hand driving, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. XPeng says most MONA buyers choose the smart-driving versions.", "body_zh": "小鹏周二发布 MONA L05，共六款车型，限时优惠后售价 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。新车提供纯电和增程两种动力。由于此前的 L03 交付拖延严重，小鹏这次在上市前就提前生产了 5000 台 L05。\n\nL05 车长 4870 毫米，但轴距达到 2940 毫米，因此车内空间更宽敞。前备厢容积 102 升，后排座椅放倒后空间可扩展到 1913 升。小鹏现场演示了五人满座时能装下九个行李箱。\n\n纯电版最高续航 635 公里，电量从 30% 充到 80% 约需 16 分钟。增程版综合续航可达 1310 公里。顶配车型搭载两颗小鹏自研 AI 芯片，用于支持高阶智驾系统。\n\nMONA 系列累计销量已超过 36 万台。L05 从立项起就同时开发左舵和右舵版本，小鹏计划在 82 个国家销售，并于 2027 年初进入欧洲。小鹏表示，多数 MONA 买家会选择智驾版本。", "text": "XPeng launched the MONA L05 on Tuesday, with six versions priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan after a limited discount. The car comes in pure electric and extended-range forms. Because the earlier L03 model faced long delivery delays, XPeng built 5,000 L05 cars before the launch. The L05 is 4,870mm long, but its wheelbase reaches 2,940mm, so passengers get more room inside. The front boot holds 102 litres, while the rear space grows to 1,913 litres when the seats fold down. XPeng showed that nine suitcases fit when five people are on board. The electric version offers up to 635km of range and charges from 30% to 80% in about 16 minutes. The extended-range model can travel 1,310km in total. Top versions use two of XPeng's own AI chips, which support its advanced driver-assistance system. The MONA series has now sold more than 360,000 cars. The L05 was designed for both left-hand and right-hand driving, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. XPeng says most MONA buyers choose the smart-driving versions.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；上市", "note": "常用于新车、新产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "delivery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "交付", "note": "汽车行业常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wheelbase", "pos": "noun", "zh": "轴距", "note": "描述车内空间时常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "range", "pos": "noun", "zh": "续航里程", "note": "电动车话题高频词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "充电", "note": "charge from 30% to 80%", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "extended-range", "pos": "adj", "zh": "增程的", "note": "指带燃油发电机的电动车", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本；车型", "note": "top version 指顶配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fold down", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "放倒；折叠", "note": "指座椅放倒", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "driver-assistance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "驾驶辅助", "note": "advanced driver-assistance system", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "enter", "pos": "verb", "zh": "进入（市场）", "note": "enter Europe 指进入欧洲市场", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-30T01:15:22.943324", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "XPeng", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.75, "sm": 300, "em": 750, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "launched", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.1, "sm": 750, "em": 1100, "cs": 6, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.212, "sm": 1100, "em": 1212, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "MONA", "s": 1.212, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1212, "em": 1549, "cs": 19, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "L", "s": 1.55, "e": 1.854, "sm": 1550, "em": 1854, "cs": 24, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "05", "s": 1.854, "e": 2.462, "sm": 1854, "em": 2462, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "on", "s": 2.462, "e": 2.663, "sm": 2462, "em": 2662, "cs": 28, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Tuesday", "s": 2.663, "e": 3.5, "sm": 2662, "em": 3499, "cs": 31, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ",", "s": 3.5, "e": 3.625, "sm": 3500, "em": 3625, "cs": 38, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "with", "s": 3.625, "e": 3.812, "sm": 3625, "em": 3812, "cs": 40, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "six", "s": 3.812, "e": 4.1, "sm": 3812, "em": 4099, "cs": 45, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "versions", "s": 4.1, "e": 4.625, "sm": 4100, "em": 4625, "cs": 49, "ce": 57, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "priced", "s": 4.625, "e": 4.975, "sm": 4625, "em": 4974, "cs": 58, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "from", "s": 4.975, "e": 5.125, "sm": 4975, "em": 5125, "cs": 65, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "139,800", "s": 5.125, "e": 7.55, "sm": 5125, "e